{"name": "Starling", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/e5db9648b0810526bb274e15d6b2e90d.avif?t=1772079190\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br/>Starling</strong> is a student-developed third-person base-building exploration game. As an employee of Starling Corp., your mission is to gather resources from across the galaxy and send it back to the corporation to supply your home planet with resources essential for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/15eae374857f21e0ac2e4eefcc76f391.avif?t=1772079190\" width=\"616\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/3db2da661fb1c2215a0a69fdf818ee4f.poster.avif?t=1772079190\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/3db2da661fb1c2215a0a69fdf818ee4f.webm?t=1772079190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/3db2da661fb1c2215a0a69fdf818ee4f.mp4?t=1772079190\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These cute creatures will guide and accompany you throughout your journey.  <br/>Finding legendary items might unlock cosmetic for your new cosmic friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/da3edd7358db9bd0e4bb3e9cf6f9d0fe.avif?t=1772079190\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/b706f7ee11637950ee7eff01ee9d3d52.poster.avif?t=1772079190\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/b706f7ee11637950ee7eff01ee9d3d52.webm?t=1772079190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/b706f7ee11637950ee7eff01ee9d3d52.mp4?t=1772079190\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world around you using your jetpack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into deep mines to extract valuable minerals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chop down alien trees for wood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fish in serene waters to secure essential supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your tools to access more resources</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use these resources to upgrade your gear, repair your base, craft consumables and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"103\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/2b787f9aaae8503883b02ffbf24a635d.avif?t=1772079190\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/2dfae846536dd1998e2de3f4bd1ce37c.poster.avif?t=1772079190\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/2dfae846536dd1998e2de3f4bd1ce37c.webm?t=1772079190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/extras/2dfae846536dd1998e2de3f4bd1ce37c.mp4?t=1772079190\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A catastrophic space incident has left your once-thriving space station in ruins, its fragments scattered across the galaxy. <br/>Now, it\u2019s up to you to rebuild your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/>By repairing various stations in your spaceship, you will unlock the ability to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smelt ores and refine resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft essential items for progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade goods with the Starling Corp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow crops for supplies and buffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your spacesuit at the cosmetic station</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Starling is a student made third person base-building exploration game. As an employee of Starling Corp., your mission is to gather resources from across the galaxy. After an unexpected turn of events, you will need to rebuild your base while being assisted by adorable creatures known as starlings.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412850/header.jpg?t=1772079190", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Singleplayer", "Exploration", "Farming Sim", "Adventure", "Crafting"], "developers": "Cozymos", "publishers": "Cozymos", "release_date": "Jan 25, 2025", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "3412850", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "25 January 2025 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/4qXYW34txF8", "first_seen": 1737763200.0, "review_rank": 1890}